* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe 对 LF-only 的批处理会解析错乱（括号块、chcp 失效），必须保留 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.onnx binary
interface.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
tasks/*.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
resource/**/default_pipeline.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
resource/**/pipeline/*.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
resource/**/pipeline/**/*.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
